uth@beta`) with `@auth/prisma-adapter` — uses JWT strategy, role stored in JWT token. Session user extended with `role`, `donViId`, `donViTen`. **Login page should be at `/login`** (configured in auth.ts)\n- **Database**: SQLite via Prisma for development (`file:./dev.db`), easily switchable to PostgreSQL\n- **3 user roles**: `admin` (full access), `editor` (can edit own unit's data), `viewer` (read-only)\n- **4-layer KTS architecture**: lop 1=hạ tầng (purple), lop 2=dữ liệu (blue), lop 3=ứng dụng (green), lop 4=kênh tương tác (orange)\n\n### Key Data Models\n- **NhiemVu.trangThai** values: `chua-bat-dau`, `dang-thuc-hien`, `hoan-thanh`, `tre-han`\n- **HeThongSo.trangThai** values: `dang-van-hanh`, `can-nang-cap`, `can-thay-the`, `ke-hoach`\n- **NhiemVu.phuongAnXuLy** values: `tiep-tuc`, `chuan-hoa`, `nang-cap`, `hop-nhat`, `thay-the`, `tich-hop`, `bo-sung`\n\n### Environment Issues Found\n- PowerShell execution policy was disabled — fixed with `Set-ExecutionPolicy RemoteSigned -Scope CurrentUser`\n- Must prepend `$env:PATH = \"C:\\Program Files\\nodejs;\" + $env:PATH` to all Node commands in new PowerShell sessions, OR open a new terminal (Node was just installed)\n- npm warns about `allow-scripts` for some packages (unrs-resolver, esbuild, msgpackr-extract, workerd) — safe to approve with `npm approve-scripts --allow-scripts-pending`\n- next-auth v5 uses `AUTH_SECRET` env var (not `NEXTAUTH_SECRET`) — both set in .env to be safe\n\n### What's NOT Yet Done (critical for running)\n- **DB not initialized** — `npx prisma db push` and `npx prisma generate` not yet run\n- **Seed not run** — `npx ts-node prisma/seed.ts` not run yet\n- **Many UI pages missing** (see Next Steps)\n- **package.json** not updated with prisma seed script or ts-node config\n\n---\n\n## 5. Files and Code\n\n### Edited/Created Files\n| File | Status | Notes |\n|------|--------|-------|\n| `C:\\Delta Force\\kts-vinhlong\\.env` | Created | DB URL + auth secrets |\n| `C:\\Delta Force\\kts-vinhlong\\